    "multiPatternControl": "Refreshed the existing measure-batched control across sparse and dense corpora with 1, 10 and 100 patterns (six cells). It remained observational and did not change the existing SearchManyLiteralMatcher implementation.",
    "semanticBoundary": "The change does not alter source planning, row cardinality, output ordering, coordinates, cancellation, byte mapping or resource ownership."
